Package: appropedia
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Interacting with Appropedia
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Emilio",
      "Velis",
      email = "emilio.velis@appropedia.org",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
  ))
Description: Tools for interacting with Appropedia through the MediaWiki
    and Semantic MediaWiki APIs. The package includes functions to retrieve
    page content, categories, and semantic properties; resolve redirects;
    manage authenticated sessions; edit template parameters; and run
    large batch workflows with checkpointing support.
